+
+// Census (KYTY_FRAME_CENSUS=1) of the check the execution thread makes before it uses a dispatch that was
+// resolved ahead of time: how long the check takes per shader, how often it fails, and whether resolving
+// again then gives anything different.  Execution thread only.
