+	             "[kyty-gpu-peek] summary of the last %.0f s: %llu validations of GPU written bytes answered from the value "
+	             "the GPU wrote the times before, %llu read from the GPU with a wait (%llu of those found a change); %llu of "
+	             "the assumed values checked against a copy made without waiting, %llu of the checks found a change\n",
+	             static_cast<double>(now - last) / 1e9, static_cast<unsigned long long>(assumed),
+	             static_cast<unsigned long long>(waited), static_cast<unsigned long long>(waited_changed),
+	             static_cast<unsigned long long>(checked), static_cast<unsigned long long>(checked_changed));
